  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"Origin.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>Origin</code></a> for an item loaded from a text resource. Provides access to the original\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/Resource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>Resource</code></a> that loaded the text and a <a href=\"TextResourceOrigin.Location.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>TextResourceOrigin.Location</code></a> within it. If the provided\nresource provides an <a href=\"Origin.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>Origin</code></a> (e.g. it is an <a href=\"OriginTrackedResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>OriginTrackedResource</code></a>), then\nit will be used as the <a href=\"Origin.html#getParent()\"><code>origin parent</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"Origin.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>Origin</code></a> 用于从文本资源加载的项目。提供对加载该文本的原始 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/Resource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>Resource</code></a> 以及其中包含的 <a href=\"TextResourceOrigin.Location.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>TextResourceOrigin.Location</code></a> 的访问。如果提供的资源提供 <a href=\"Origin.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>Origin</code></a>（例如，它是一个 <a href=\"OriginTrackedResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.origin\"><code>OriginTrackedResource</code></a>），则将其用作 <a href=\"Origin.html#getParent()\"><code>origin parent</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the location of the property within the source (if known).",
      "translation": "返回该属性在源代码中的位置（如果已知）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the resource where the property originated.",
      "translation": "返回属性来源的资源。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the text resource or <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "文本资源或<code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the location or <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "位置或<code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"Origin.html#getParent()\">Origin</a></code></span>",
